{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は番組収録してきました!広島のローカル番組"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アグレッシブですけど、何か?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや(和田まあやchan)と２人て頑張りました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー広島おるときCMいっぱい見てたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか出演させていただけるなんて(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん自身オンエアが広島で見れんのが残念なけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも恥ずかしいので地元の友達には出演することは秘密です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組の中で「いつもみてましたー♪」なんて言いましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深夜番組なので、実はいつもは見てられ...ごほっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも予告のCMは本当にいつも見てるし、存在はもちろん知っております(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって全国区だって思ってたくらい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組は反省点だらけなので、これからひとり反省会しようと思います...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島ホームテレビ見れるぜーって方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだトークがぐだぐだで、無茶ぶりが苦手な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「素」そのものの私たちをお楽しみください(^ω^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ。なんでこんなプレゼンしかできないのよあたしは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり反省会してきまする('・ω・`)るるる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合宿どうだったのよっていろんな方に言われたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単に書きましょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばすのって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドッジボールして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の歴史なんか学びました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達いっぱいできたから楽しかった!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕の誕生日26日は大阪の個握の近く!!祝ってくれる(^^)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って今言ってもいいけど、せっかくだから直接言いたいよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼく26日誕生日なんよってちゃんと言ってくださいね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で応援しますよー(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんにツンデレしてもいいのかな?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいけど、ひめたんはそんなに器用な人じゃないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でれでれしてくれる人が好きなんだけどな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のときにこんなことを話してもらえるとうれしい、とかはある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの好きなところを延々と熱く語る"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかゆーて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日のお手紙、大阪の握手会の時でいいかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってる(^^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこ焼きかお好み焼きどっちが好きなん?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこは食べれないけどやきは大好きだよひめたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼きは広島風がいいな。え?せっかく関西いくのにって?わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別で言ってもらいたい言葉があるんですが...リクエストしても良い...?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何ですかなんですかー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんなりとお申し付けくださいよ＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次がまだひめたんに会うの大阪のミニ握以来の２回目なんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメントしてる名前言ったら覚えてくれる??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おお!2ヶ月ぶりってことですね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの名前言ってくれたら「ああ!」ってなりますよー言っていって♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ久しぶりにあえるの楽しみにしてるんるん(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手紙やプレゼントを送ろーって思ってたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう頑張っても間に合わないーっ(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪の個握で渡そうかなーって(^^;)...いいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか許しくださいね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつでもいいですよってかむしろ嬉しいし申し訳ないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの大阪の思い出はどんなのがあるかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある日ぱぱとままに「ドライブ行くよー♪」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島から大阪までドライブしました(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で食い倒れして日帰り!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵しょー???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪の全握では日芽香ちゃんのパフォーマンスを観れるかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待大∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかゆーて自分で自分のハードルをあげてみたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ間違いなく中元さんのパフォーマンスみれますよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/27/5645938/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴールデンウィークに広島帰るんじゃけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の広島のオススメスポットorグルメはなんかありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴールデンウィークといえばフラワーしか(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はひめたんも東京おるけわからんのんよね←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}